    "show_share": true,
    "description": "IED commended the leadership, dedication, and hard work of Professor Nelofer Halai and Dr Kulsoom Jaffer at a celebratory gathering. The AKU leadership and IED family appreciated the retiring faculty for their services and contribution.",
